# Committed outputs live in predictions/ (forecast history) and
# reports/*.json (measured figures). The HTML pages are generated every run
# and deployed from the Pages artifact, not from the repo: tracking them let
# two runs collide on a generated file.
reports/*.html
reports/*.tmp

# Personal working notes, kept out of the published tree
docs/

